                                                "sense_id": "a5441433-c1f2-3721-9b71-244b87aa2fc6",
                                                "text": "The main tenets of Extropianism are ‘boundless expansion, self-transformation, dynamic optimism, intelligent technology, and spontaneous order’. The goal of Extropianism is to enable those who want to be at the vanguard of the incumbent transformation into a ‘posthuman’ age."
